 "notes": "Endpoints: the committed swagger (assets/swagger.json, /api/v1) is served by grpc-gateway generated code (pkg/apiclient/**/*.pb.gw.go) mounted with mux.Handle(\"/api/\", handler) — nothing the extractor can see (generated-server, recall ~0 by design). The hand-written net/http routes in server/ were added after reading the source; mux.Handle(\"/api/\", gw) and mux.Handle(\"/\"+root+\"/\", StripPrefix(...)) are subtree mounts that come out as routes (mount-as-route), and registerDownloadHandlers(mux, base) builds paths from a string parameter (prefix-as-param). Calls: the React UI goes through ui/src/app/shared/services/requests.ts, whose get/post/put/delete prepend apiRoot() = /api/v1 — the paths come out without it (prefix-in-client-wrapper, H2-D12: the prefix is in the code). Calls written as requests\\n    .put(\"/x\") (receiver on the previous line) are not extracted at all (multiline-receiver). Expected calls = every requests.* call in five sampled service files. s.symlinksState.Get(key) is a cache lookup taken for an HTTP GET (non-http-verb).",
